  "question": {
    "text": "All the letters of the word <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>Y</mi></math> are written in all possible ways with or without meaning and these words are written as in a dictionary. The serial number of the word <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>Y</mi></math> IS"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "553",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have to find the rank of word <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>Y</mi></math>.</p><p>Words starting from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>720</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>360</mn></math></p><p>Words starting with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></math></p><p>Words starting with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></math></p><p>Words starting with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p>Words starting with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p>Words starting with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p>Then the next word will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>Y</mi></math> and its rank will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>360</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>553</mn></math></p>"
  }
